\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 Maile thought about it, and then pushed the sleeve up further, to a place above the elbow where there was nothing at all to see, and looked at the nothing for a while with a different face on.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 \u8220 ?Huh,\u8221 ? she said.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 Kathy gave the arm back. She did it gently, and she was already looking somewhere else.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 \u8220 ?Hayley.\u8221 ?\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 \u8220 ?Mm.\u8221 ?\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 \u8220 ?The ones by the curtains. What have they got in common?\u8221 ?\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 Hayley did not answer straight away, which was how Sarah knew she had been working on it since the chesterfield.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 \u8220 ?They were all at Bent Street,\u8221 ? Hayley said. \u8220 ?And they\u8217 ?re the only ones here who look like they weren\u8217 ?t.\u8221 ?\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 \u8220 ?That\u8217 ?s not it, though. Plenty were at Bent Street.\u8221 ? Kathy had her back half to the room now, and her voice had come down to the register she used for the parts of her job that were nobody\u8217 ?s business. \u8220 ?Whatever this is, it isn\u8217 ?t pathogenic. It\u8217 ?s the other thing. It\u8217 ?s salutogenic. It doesn\u8217 ?t make you sick, it goes through and tidies. And it\u8217 ?s had about a fortnight in her.\u8221 ?\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

