\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 \u8220 ?A fortnight in her. Longer in some of them. It isn\u8217 ?t the weather, it isn\u8217 ?t the water, and it is not clean living.\u8221 ? Kathy put both hands flat on the bar. \u8220 ?It\u8217 ?s a thing, and things come from somewhere, and it goes body to body or it wouldn\u8217 ?t be a set.\u8221 ?\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 Which was when Chanta arrived with a beer in each hand and no idea how to shake with either.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 \u8220 ?G\u8217 ?day,\u8221 ? he said. \u8220 ?Good speech. Bit sad in the middle.\u8221 ?\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 Nobody answered him.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 Hayley had turned round very slowly and was looking at the Elvisettes behind him \u8212 ? at Betty Lee, whose hair had gone entirely back to blonde at the roots, and at Marguerita, who had had a crook knee for six years and had done the splits at a party on Tuesday.\
