\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 \u8220 ?Depends which. Betty\u8217 ?s ages. Marguerita, ooh.\u8221 ? He worked at it. \u8220 ?Fortnight? Give or take.\u8221 ?\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 The bar went quiet in a small local way, the way a bar does around one conversation while the rest of the room goes on being loud.\
