\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 \u8220 ?It is not that simple.\u8221 ?\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 \u8220 ?It\u8217 ?s exactly that simple,\u8221 ? said Chanta, with the terrible confidence of a man who has arrived at the correct answer by a route nobody can follow, \u8220 ?you\u8217 ?ve just been saying it wrong.\u8221 ?\
